(   Taking moments about the pivot edge:) Tj
T*
(   Overturning moment = P * y; Restoring moment = W * \(b / 2\).) Tj
T*
(   At impending tipping: P_tip * y = W * \(b / 2\) => P_tip = W * \(b / 2*y\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
