T*
(   1. Geometry: Inner radius r1, outer radius r2, axial spring clamping force W, friction mu, n) Tj
T*
(   pairs of friction surfaces.) Tj
T*
(   2. Uniform Wear Theory \(Standard for Clutches\):) Tj
