(   [Problem Statement]: Prove that for an automobile negotiating a flat unbanked curved road of radius R, the maximum safe speed is v_max = sqrt\(mu * g * R\).) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Problem Context & Governing Principles:) Tj
T*
(   This problem investigates the limiting equilibrium and friction mechanics for civil engineering) Tj
T*
(   applications.) Tj
