(   2. Mathematical Formulation & Step-by-Step Analysis:) Tj
T*
(   Skidding Speed on Unbanked Curve:) Tj
T*
(   1. Dynamic Equilibrium: Centripetal acceleration a_n = v^2 / R requires centripetal force) Tj
T*
(   provided solely by lateral tire friction:) Tj
T*
(   F_f = m * v^2 / R.) Tj
T*
(   2. Limiting Friction: F_f <= mu * N = mu * m * g.) Tj
T*
(   3. Maximum Speed: m * v^2 / R <= mu * m * g => v^2 <= mu * g * R => v_max = sqrt\(mu * g * R\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
