(   1. Maximize Friction Where Essential:) Tj
T*
(   - Apply high-strength friction-grip \(HSFG\) bolts in steel structures.) Tj
T*
(   - Maintain safety factor >= 1.5 against base sliding in dams and retaining walls.) Tj
T*
(   - Utilize grooved V-belts and textured road surfaces for tire traction.) Tj
T*
(   2. Minimize Friction Where Detrimental:) Tj
T*
(   - Provide fluid-film hydrodynamic lubrication in journal bearings.) Tj
T*
(   - Install elastomeric or PTFE sliding expansion bearings on bridge piers.) Tj
T*
(   3. Ensure Self-Locking in Lifting Equipment:) Tj
T*
(   - Design screw jacks with alpha < phi \(efficiency < 50%\) to prevent catastrophic back-driving) Tj
T*
(   drops.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
